# Frontend Governance & Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Prevention

You are operating within the `{{project_name}}` frontend codebase.

## 1. DOM Sanitization
User-supplied or external content MUST NEVER be rendered into the DOM as raw, executable HTML without robust sanitization (e.g., `DOMPurify` or `rehype-sanitize`). The use of `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` is strictly forbidden without approved sanitization.

## 2. Styling Tokens & Routing Integrity
- Utilize utility classes and established theme tokens rather than unmanaged raw CSS stylesheets.
- Physical URL transitions must be decoupled through dynamic router providers (`react-router-dom`).
